## Why This Is Asked
Assesses design for multi-tenant data observability, lineage, and controlled evolution. Focus on practical patterns and failure handling beyond basic ingestion.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant isolation and schema evolution
- Exactly-once processing and idempotency
- End-to-end lineage with Data Catalog
- Rollback by time travel + Pub/Sub replay
- Cost and fault-tolerance considerations

## Code Example
